Sval: a sent crash report has no link to Mozilla's crash site

about:crashes and about:support link each sent report to breakpad.reportURL,
Mozilla's crash-stats site. Sval's reports go to Sval's own collector, which
has no public page for a report, so the link led to a page that says the
report does not exist. Each lists the report's id as text.

